                  },
                  {
                    "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
                    "id": "8418194",
                    "source": "PubMed"
                  }
                ],
                "value": "Also found in cell surface (T cells), cytosol and extracellular matrix (PubMed:10358038). During oocyte maturation and after parthenogenetic activation accumulates in cortical granules. In pronuclear and early cleaved embryos localizes weakly to cytoplasm around nucleus and more strongly in the region near the cortex (By similarity). In cortical granules of non-activated oocytes, is exocytosed during the cortical reaction in response to oocyte activation (By similarity)"
              }
            ]
